  "title": "Honey-Sesame Leftover Rotisserie Chicken Salad",
  "description": "Dress up leftover rotisserie chicken with crunchy vegetables, mandarin oranges, and a creamy cilantro dressing to make this Asian-inspired honey-sesame chicken salad.",
